Package: mercury-skypulse
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mercury SkyPulse contributors
Depends: libc6, libegl1, libgl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libasound2, libpulse0, libpipewire-0.3-0, libhamlib4 | libhamlib4t64
Description: Mercury-based amateur-radio digital communications station
 Mercury SkyPulse provides chat, short voice messages, beacon, ping, file transfer,
 BBS, location, reporting, and station controls through a bundled Mercury modem runtime.
